flowchart TD
    PERSON["Listener"] -->|Speak or interrupt| PLAYER["React discussion player"]
    PLAYER -->|Microphone audio| STT["ElevenLabs Scribe v3 Live"]
    PLAYER -->|Listener starts speaking| SCHEDULE["FastAPI selects the next speaker and tracks interruptions"]
    STT -->|Committed listener turn| HISTORY

    CORPUS["Multilingual articles and public releases"] --> INDEX["Shared event index with original passages"]
    INDEX --> RUNDOWN["Select ordered stories for listener profile and duration"]
    RUNDOWN --> RECOMMENDER["Rank eligible guest experts for each event"]
    CATALOG["Persona catalog with expertise, prompts, model settings and voice IDs"] --> RECOMMENDER
    CATALOG --> MODERATOR["Main host introduces panel and headlines, questions experts and closes"]
    MODERATOR --> SCHEDULE
    RECOMMENDER -->|Ranked host IDs| SCHEDULE
    HISTORY["Ordered listener and host turns"] --> SCHEDULE

    SCHEDULE -->|Chosen host and turn to answer| LOOKUP["Retrieve a bounded set of original passages"]
    INDEX --> REVIEW["Compare common ground, measurement bases and disputed figures"]
    REVIEW --> LOOKUP
    LOOKUP --> HOST["Call the chosen host model with its persona and recent turns"]
    HOST -->|Host turn with claim citations| VERIFY["Verify quotes and figures against original sources"]
    VERIFY -->|Approved turn with citations| CURRENT{"Is the turn still current?"}
    VERIFY -->|Still unsupported after one repair| STATUS["Render uncertainty statement"]
    STATUS --> PLAYER
    CURRENT -->|Superseded| DROP["Discard stale turn"]
    CURRENT -->|Current| TTS["Render or reuse audio in the selected host's ElevenLabs voice"]
    TTS -->|If still current, play the turn with its sources| PLAYER
    PLAYER -->|Turn finished| HISTORY
    PLAYER -->|Audio and source cards| PERSON
    HISTORY -->|Queue a host reply if the listener has not interrupted| SCHEDULE
